Operator ceiling against order. Observed pileup at kh = 2.55;
the half-spectral rule sits at pi/2 = 1.5708 for every order.

order    max k_eff h      at kh   2 sum|c_n|  vs observed
4             2.3333     3.1416       2.3333      -0.2167
6             2.4833     3.1416       2.4833      -0.0667
8             2.5726     3.1416       2.5726      +0.0226
10            2.6334     3.1416       2.6334      +0.0834
